  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening women&apos;s political representation in Armenia 2018-2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rkande av kvinnors politiska deltagande i Armenien 2018-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att &#xf6;ka kvinnors politiska representation och deltagande i Armenien f&#xf6;r att d&#xe4;rigenom bidra till en mer inkluderande utveckling i landet p&#xe5; sikt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects purpose is to strenghten women&apos;s political representation and participation in Armenina in order to reach a more inclusive development in the country in the long run.</narrative>
  </description>
